  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab><hi rend="allcaps">Twenty-First Time.</hi>
               <placeName ref="namedentities.xml#lyceum"><hi rend="allcaps">Theatre Royal, Lyceum,</hi></placeName><lb/>
               This present <hi rend="allcaps">Thursday</hi>, <date when="1812-05-28"><hi rend="allcaps">May</hi> 28, 1812</date>,<lb/>
               Their Majesties Servants will perform a New Comedy in 5 Acts, call'd The<lb/>
               <bibl><title type="main" ref="namedentities.xml#play_sons_of_erin"><hi rend="allcaps">Sons</hi> of <hi rend="allcaps">Erin</hi>;</title><lb/>
                  <title><hi rend="allcaps">Or</hi>,<lb/>
                     Modern Sentiment.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head><hi rend="allcaps">The Characters By</hi></head><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_po">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Powell</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_do">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Dowton</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#vi_de">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">De Camp</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ch_ho">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Holland</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_he_jo">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Johnstone</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#be_wr">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Wrench</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ra_we">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Wewitzer</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ma_da">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Duncan</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#el_ed">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Edwin</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#sa_sp">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Sparks</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_boyce">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Boyce</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#sa_ha">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Harlowe</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#an_sc">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Scott</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_ch">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Chatterley</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               After which (<hi rend="italic">Seventh Time</hi>) an entirely New Farce, called<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_how_to_die_for_love">How to Die For Love!</title></bibl>
               The Songs incidental to the Piece, composed by <persName ref="namedentities.xml#ch_sm">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">C. Smith</hi></persName>.<lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head>The Characters by</head><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_penson">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Penson</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#be_wr">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Wrench</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#vi_de">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">De Camp</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_knight">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Knight</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_ox">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Oxberry,</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#wa_ma">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Maddocks</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_kelly">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Kelly</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               Boxes and Places to be taken of <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mr_spring">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Spring</hi></persName>, Box Office, Strand Entrance<lb/>
               from <time when="10:00:00"><hi rend="allcaps">Ten</hi></time> till <time when="16:00:00"><hi rend="allcaps">Four</hi></time>, &amp; of whom may be had <hi rend="allcaps">Private Boxes</hi> Nightly.<lb/>
               Boxes <measure type="currency">6s.</measure> Second Price <measure type="currency">3s</measure>. Pit <measure type="currency">3s. 6d</measure>. Second Price <measure type="currency">2s</measure>. Gallery <measure type="currency">2s</measure>.<lb/>
               Second Price <measure type="currency">1s</measure>. Upper Gallery <measure type="currency">1s</measure>. Second Price <measure type="currency">6d</measure>.<lb/>
               The Doors to be Opened at <time when="17:30:00">Half-Past Five</time>, and to commence at <time when="18:30:00">Half-past Six</time>.<lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">Vivant Rex et Regina!-No Money to be Returned</hi></ab>
         </div>
